mes 5-6 read lit like day, the night approach back wall stays near-black, a wall-foot brick still clips the gameplay corner, the yard floor is sparse. CPU no longer closes a row: OFF until the GPU pass."},
+  "warden_rim_candidate": {"enabled": false, "_why": "F22#4 close-out (OFF until judged; lighting only, shadowless spots, no gameplay change). GPU J and CPU co2 judges: the dark armoured Burrowback sinks into the dark hall floor with no rim. Two `lights` entries carry `flag: warden_rim_candidate`: a cool rim from behind the Warden's side of the ring and a warm top key over the fight floor, so both creatures lift off the floor. Roofed room, so not in the exterior omni budget.", "_parked": "PARKED (26 Oct; F22#4 parked per coordinator): two CPU attempts (r1 rim behind the camera side, r2 rim from the far south-east side at energy 12 plus top key 6), captured with capture_named_fight warden_aldis on top of co2, show no visible change on Burrowback or the floor against co2. Not judged. Likely the Compatibility per-object light cap in this lit room."},
